#: ../../source/reference/generated/utils/pams.utils.JsonRandom.rst:7
msgid "JsonRandom"
msgstr ""

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom:1
msgid "random generator from json."
msgstr "JSONの指定に基づく乱数生成器。"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom:9
msgid "The following direction can be used for config as randomized values:"
msgstr "設定ファイルでは、ランダムな値として次の指定を使用できます："

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom:4
msgid ""
":code:`[a, b]`: uniform distribution on :math:`[a, b)`. Both bounds are "
"converted into float and a float is returned, so :math:`a \\leq x < b` "
"always holds; convert it into int by yourself if needed."
msgstr ""
":code:`[a, b]`：:math:`[a, b)` 上の一様分布。両端の値はfloatに変換され、floatが返されるため、常に "
":math:`a \\leq x < b` が成り立ちます。必要であれば、自分でintに変換してください。"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":code:`{\"const\": [a]}`: constant value. Always set to a."
msgstr ":code:`{\"const\": [a]}`：定数値。常にaに設定されます。"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ":code:`{\"uniform\": [a, b]}`: same as [a, b]"
msgstr ":code:`{\"uniform\": [a, b]}`：[a, b] と同じ"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom:8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":code:`{\"normal\": [u, s]}`: normal distribution whose mean and deviation "
"is u and s."
msgstr ":code:`{\"normal\": [u, s]}`：平均がu、標準偏差がsの正規分布。"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom:9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":code:`{\"expon\": [lam]}`: exponential distribution whose mean and "
"deviation is lam."
msgstr ":code:`{\"expon\": [lam]}`：平均と標準偏差がともにlamの指数分布。"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom:12
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom.random:1
msgid "get a random value."
msgstr "乱数値を取得します。"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom.random
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom.random:4
msgid ""
"random type. This can include the parameter \"const\", \"uniform\", "
"\"normal\", and \"expon\"."
msgstr "乱数の種類。「const」、「uniform」、「normal」、「expon」のパラメータを含めることができます。"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom.random
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom.random:8
msgid "random value."
msgstr "乱数値。"

#: of pams.utils.json_random.JsonRandom.random
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

